%% UML Component Diagram (Mermaid, Schwarz-Weiss)
classDiagram
    direction LR

    class Nutzer {
      <<actor>>
    }

    class LLMClient {
      <<component>>
      +ask(question)
      +render_answer()
    }

    class MCPServer {
      <<component>>
      +search_exact_keyword()
      +search_phrase_proximity()
      +search_fuzzy()
      +search_semantic()
      +search_smart()
    }

    class ElasticSearch {
      <<component>>
      +query(index, clause)
      +return_hits()
    }

    class IngestionPipeline {
      <<component>>
      +extract_pdf_text()
      +chunk_text()
      +index_documents()
    }

    class PDFKorpus {
      <<artifact>>
      +pdf_files
    }

    class LLMProvider {
      <<component>>
      +generate_answer()
      +tool_call_planning()
    }

    Nutzer --> LLMClient : stellt Frage
    LLMClient --> MCPServer : list_tools()
    LLMClient --> MCPServer : Tool-Aufruf
    MCPServer --> ElasticSearch : Suchabfrage
    IngestionPipeline --> ElasticSearch : schreibt Chunks
    PDFKorpus --> IngestionPipeline : Quelldokumente
    LLMClient --> LLMProvider : Gemini API oder Ollama lokal
